      "translationZh": "将 MCP 服务器的 alwaysLoad: false 更改为将该服务器的所有工具都延迟到工具搜索时加载",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0bf7a379b133c170",
      "translationZh": "更改了屏幕阅读器模式，使其在写入新行或更改行时，不再先将光标停留在行首；设置 CLAUDE_AX_PREPARK_MS=50 可恢复该停顿行为",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "300bb74871b8ff3a",
      "translationZh": "更改了在标记消息后的自动模型切换逻辑，使其保持您当前的努力程度（effort level），而不是使用新模型的默认设置",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1fdccb5d9af474a2",
      "translationZh": "更改了等待权限提示的显示方式，使其按时间从旧到新显示，这样新的提示就不会覆盖您正在阅读的提示（带有倒计时的提示仍会保持在最上方）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b8a397019ab9dabc",
      "translationZh": "[VSCode] 为正在运行的命令或子代理（sub-agent）添加了“在后台运行”功能，以便将其移至后台并继续工作",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9182c5a656045561",
      "translationZh": "[VSCode] 将后台 Shell 和监视器（Monitors）的输出添加到了代理地图（agent map）对应的卡片中",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "239215293b0be9ea",
      "translationZh": "[VSCode] 修复了设置对话框的问题，此前当 Claude Code 的回复过大导致无法确认保存时，对话框会错误地归咎于超时问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "62fe5afbe2657e33",
      "translationZh": "[VSCode] 修复了重新打开一个云会话时，如果侧边栏已将该会话带到此机器，它会再次在新标签页中打开的问题；现在会改为显示侧边栏",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "562c5ffe7c9dc1d3",
      "translationZh": "[VSCode] 修复了侧边栏的 Web 标签页无法列出窗口加载后启动的云会话的问题；加载失败时现在会显示“远程服务器未连接”，而不是“尚无 Web 会话”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "19ac63be388162ca",
      "translationZh": "[VSCode] 修复了重新加载后恢复的标签页在侧边栏已打开某个对话的情况下，会启动第二个 Claude 进程的问题；现在它会显示“仍在其他地方打开”的提示",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1634cbbb454fd5a2",
      "translationZh": "[VSCode] 修复了工具行文件链接、会话列表链接以及两个提示以纯文本形式显示的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7545a4ba068b2301",
      "translationZh": "[VSCode] 修复了后台代理仍在运行的命令在主轮次结束后显示为失败的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "478d311867d98fab",
      "translationZh": "[VSCode] 修复了用户执行自己的 /usage 或 /context 命令时，从命令菜单中选择后会打开扩展对话框而不是运行命令的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bb96578b8fd5fcaf",
      "translationZh": "[VSCode] 修复了计划预览标签页中的文件链接点击后无反应的问题；现在它们会像聊天回复中的链接一样打开文件",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "628a8ceaf31c70eb",
      "translationZh": "[VSCode] 修复了在 WSL 等远程主机上，当标签页出现缓慢时，在编辑器标签页中打开工具的输入或输出会因“等待 1000ms 后超时”而失败的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9bf5f4175ccdf2cb",
      "translationZh": "[VSCode] 改进了管理插件对话框：添加、删除或刷新市场插件失败时，现在会显示具体错误原因",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4caa2f8da0f04a39",
      "translationZh": "[VSCode] 将 Chrome 中的 Claude “默认启用”开关更改为同时连接编辑器自身的会话，这些会话在执行浏览器操作前仍会请求许可",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a579ea41c52db905",
      "translationZh": "[Cloud sessions] 修复了当 GitHub 暂时拒绝新签发的访问令牌时，偶尔会出现无法从 GitHub 获取或向其推送数据的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2b202d8414f174ac",
      "translationZh": "[Claude Tag] 修复了当 GitHub 活动等后台事件唤醒 Claude 且无人等待回复时，Claude 会在 Slack 线程中发布失败警告（例如支出限制通知）的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6211f2af7f1c7e8b",
      "translationZh": "[Claude Tag] 修复了在拥有大量频道的组织中，管理设置里的 Claude Tag 支出限制页面会遗漏最近创建的频道及私有频道的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "52e8c7aad69d2627",
      "translationZh": "[Claude Tag] 改进了长 Slack 线程中 Claude 的任务列表：后台工作不再会自动将其作为新消息重新发布，从而避免干扰正在关注该线程的人员",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "802912195666eebb",
      "translationZh": "[Code Review] 修复了查找评论及其“为何被标记”文本时会在句子中间停止的问题；现在它们会以完整的句子结尾",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "346eaca8759bc562",
      "translationZh": "[Code Review] 修复了在新的推送发生后，如果代码审查在之前的提交上已失败两次，则会跳过拉取请求的问题；现在它会审查最新的提交",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    }
  ],
